ction afterwards — that is a separate construction or composite loan, applied for once the plan is approved."}]]}]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"shell pb-4","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500382017468-9049fed747ef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","alt":"Plot loans, without the brochure — Bengaluru property","width":1600,"height":686,"className":"aspect-[21/9] w-full object-cover"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 max-w-[70ch] text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-soft)]","children":"Images are representational or supplied by the developer. This guide explains paperwork, not a specific unit."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-[var(--sheet)] text-[var(--sheet-ink)]","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell page-section grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16","children":[["$","aside",null,{"className":"hidden lg:col-span-3 lg:block","children":["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"On this page","className":"sticky top-28","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[14px] text-[var(--sheet-soft)]","children":"On this page"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","What the lender is actually assessing",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#what-the-lender-is-actually-assessing","className":"text-[var(--sheet-ink)] underline decoration-transparent underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-[var(--gold-on-light)]","children":"What the lender is actually assessing"}]}],["$","li","Documents a lender will ask for",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#documents-a-lender-will-ask-for","className":"text-[var(--sheet-ink)] underline decoration-transparent underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-[var(--gold-on-light)]","children":"Documents a lender will ask for"}]}],["$","li","Plot loan versus plot-plus-construction",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#plot-loan-versus-plot-plus-construction","className":"text-[var(--sheet-ink)] underl